	(text "Every JP ships OPEN: bridge with solder to bring the board up one stage at a time (README order); wick off to isolate. No test pad on the 10 MOhm node on purpose."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7000 175.2600 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9d38519a-3d7b-42b7-8b93-d4393ab94f32")
	)
	(text "JP3: centre -> R9. Blob to pin 3 = stage 2 (x121); move it to pin 1 = stage 1 only (x11) if stage 2 clips. C6 is DNP: fit it instead of bridging JP2 to AC-couple TX."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7000 177.8000 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "06625551-bd0d-4475-a605-e81a29fc41fd")
	)
	(text "STATUS LED — RGB common cathode on GP17/18/19, direct-solder or JST-XH 4p"
